1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,971
Imagine waking up in a world with no ice.

2
00:00:02,971 --> 00:00:06,232
No glaciers in the mountains, no white cap on

3
00:00:06,232 --> 00:00:10,217
Antarctica, no frozen Greenland. Now look at the coast.

4
00:00:10,217 --> 00:00:15,145
Miami, New Orleans, Cancún, London, Shanghai: gone, underwater. What

5
00:00:15,145 --> 00:00:18,116
would the planet look like if all the ice

6
00:00:18,116 --> 00:00:21,377
on Earth melted? And how close are we really?

7
00:00:21,377 --> 00:00:22,464
Let's find out.

8
00:00:23,014 --> 00:00:26,475
Welcome to Earth Decoded. If you love the most

9
00:00:26,475 --> 00:00:30,764
extreme places on our planet, tap subscribe. Today, we're

10
00:00:30,764 --> 00:00:34,375
melting every glacier on the planet, at least in

